  "entries_absence": {
    "absence": "river_structure_not_banked",
    "why": "`count` and `rivers[]` are one entry PER BANKED, PUBLISHED WALK, not per river: a river composed of several walks is served as several entries (the Willamette basin's nine walks are nine entries, each named by its own key). Which walks compose one river, and the river's label and basin, are the geo.rivers.v1 registry's and are NOT banked in Neon (D-09-25-252 \u00a75, pantry lane d091790); this route reads no R2, so it cannot compose them and does not try. The field keeps the name `rivers` so that the day the structure is banked is additive."
  },
